(Bernadette:)Yeah.

9
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:22,633
(Howard:)Are you sure?

10
00:00:24,105 --> 00:00:26,405
(Bernadette:)Pretty positive.

11
00:00:26,407 --> 00:00:28,207
(Bernadette:)That's a joke, because
the pregnancy test says...

12
00:00:28,209 --> 00:00:29,739
(Howard:)Oh, my God.

13
00:00:32,546 --> 00:00:34,076
(Howard:)This is incredible.

14
00:00:34,081 --> 00:00:36,681
(Howard:)We're gonna be parents?

15
00:00:36,684 --> 00:00:40,154
(Howard:)We're gonna get
to board planes first.

16
00:00:41,288 --> 00:00:42,918
(Howard:)Finally gonna get to see

17
00:00:42,923 --> 00:00:46,423
