at the mall.

18
00:00:46,427 --> 00:00:48,557
(Bernadette:)I know, it's crazy.

19
00:00:48,562 --> 00:00:50,662
(Howard:)It is crazy.

20
00:00:50,664 --> 00:00:51,964
(Howard:)Oh.

21
00:00:51,966 --> 00:00:55,706
(Howard:)I mean, how do you... prepare
for something like this?

22
00:00:55,703 --> 00:00:58,903
(Howard:)I'm not even sure
I've held a baby before.

23
00:00:58,906 --> 00:01:00,606
(Bernadette:)Oh, it's okay,
you'll figure it out.

